e at least 49 days before Election Day. Open Hearing Warrant articles for the town meeting are reviewed at Open Hearings. Annual Town Meeting Final warrant articles for the town are voted on at the Annual Town Meeting. Special Town Meeting Special Town Meetings are meetings called to vote on a specific topic. Annual Town Election Candidates for town office are voted on as well as any ballot questions at the Annual Town Election. State Elections State Elections are elections held for state and federal candidates as well as ballot questions. 
     

 
